{
  "format": "xuexi-authored@1",
  "lessonId": "en-g4a.u1.words.lecture",
  "title": "Where do people live? 城市和乡村的单词",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "情境导入：深圳的家和老家的农场",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "Where do people live?" },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "人们住在哪里？" },
        { "id": "c1", "kind": "cards", "items": [
          { "id": "c1a", "text": "深圳：高楼、街道", "color": "blue" },
          { "id": "c1b", "text": "老家：农场、小房子", "color": "green" }
        ] }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "同学们好！今天我们学习第一单元。先跟我读单元的大问题。" },
        { "spotlight": "h1" },
        { "say": "Where do people live?", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "意思是：人们住在哪里？" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "我们住在深圳，这里有很多高楼，还有长长的街道。" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "有的同学放假会回老家，老家有农场，还有一栋栋小房子。" },
        { "say": "城市和乡村，住的地方可不一样。我们来学这些地方的英语单词。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "新单词（一）：城市里",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "In the city 城市里" },
        { "id": "c1", "kind": "cards", "items": [
          { "id": "c1a", "text": "city 城市", "color": "blue" },
          { "id": "c1b", "text": "building 楼房", "color": "orange" },
          { "id": "c1c", "text": "flat 公寓", "color": "green" },
          { "id": "c1d", "text": "street 街道", "color": "purple" }
        ] },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "Shenzhen is a big city." }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "先学城市里的四个单词。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "第一个词，意思是城市。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "city, city", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "深圳是一座大城市。跟我读这句话。" },
        { "say": "Shenzhen is a big city.", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "城市里有很多高高的楼房。这个词的意思是楼房、建筑。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "building, building", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1c" },
        { "say": "楼房里的一套房子，就是公寓。我们很多同学家就住在公寓里。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "flat, flat", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1d" },
        { "say": "楼房外面是街道，汽车在上面跑。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "street, street", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "新单词（二）：乡村里",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "In the country 乡村里" },
        { "id": "c1", "kind": "cards", "items": [
          { "id": "c1a", "text": "country 乡村", "color": "green" },
          { "id": "c1b", "text": "farm 农场", "color": "orange" },
          { "id": "c1c", "text": "house 房子（一栋）", "color": "blue" }
        ] },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "There is a farm in the country." }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "再来看乡村里的三个单词。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "这个词的意思是乡村，和城市正好相对。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "country, country", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "乡村里有农场，养着牛、猪和鸭子。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "farm, farm", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1c" },
        { "say": "农场旁边有一栋小房子，一整栋的房子叫这个词。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "house, house", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "乡村里有一个农场。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "There is a farm in the country.", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "分一分：城市还是乡村",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "City or country?" },
        { "id": "g1", "kind": "table", "rows": [
          ["city 城市", "country 乡村"],
          ["building 楼房", "farm 农场"],
          ["flat 公寓", "house 房子"],
          ["street 街道", ""]
        ] },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "flat：楼里的一套　house：一整栋" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "我们把七个单词分成两组。左边是城市里的，右边是乡村里的。" },
        { "spotlight": "g1" },
        { "say": "跟我一起读左边一列。" },
        { "say": "city, building, flat, street", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "再读右边一列。" },
        { "say": "country, farm, house", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "注意，公寓和房子都是住的地方，但不一样。" },
        { "say": "公寓是高楼里的一套房子；房子是独立的一整栋，常常还带个小院子。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "情景对话",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "Talk about homes" },
        { "id": "g1", "kind": "table", "rows": [
          ["Amy", "Look! Shenzhen is a big city."],
          ["Ben", "There are many tall buildings."],
          ["Amy", "My home is a flat on this street."],
          ["Ben", "My grandparents live in the country."],
          ["Amy", "Do they have a farm?"],
          ["Ben", "Yes. They have a farm and a small house."]
        ] }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "艾米和本在聊自己的家。我们一句一句跟读。" },
        { "spotlight": "g1" },
        { "say": "艾米说：看，深圳是一座大城市。" },
        { "say": "Look! Shenzhen is a big city.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "本说：这里有很多高楼。" },
        { "say": "There are many tall buildings.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "艾米说：我的家是这条街上的一套公寓。" },
        { "say": "My home is a flat on this street.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "本说：我的爷爷奶奶住在乡村。" },
        { "say": "My grandparents live in the country.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "艾米问：他们有农场吗？" },
        { "say": "Do they have a farm?", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "本说：有，他们有一个农场和一栋小房子。" },
        { "say": "Yes. They have a farm and a small house.", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "语音：字母 a 的短音",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "Sound: a" },
        { "id": "c1", "kind": "cards", "items": [
          { "id": "c1a", "text": "cat 猫", "color": "orange" },
          { "id": "c1b", "text": "flat 公寓", "color": "green" },
          { "id": "c1c", "text": "map 地图", "color": "blue" },
          { "id": "c1d", "text": "bag 书包", "color": "purple" }
        ] },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "对比：cake、name 里的 a 读字母本身的音" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "最后学发音。这四个单词里有同一个元音字母，它读短音，嘴巴张大，声音短短的。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "cat, cat", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "flat, flat", "lang": "en" },
        { "board": [
          { "text": "f - l - a - t → flat" },
          { "text": "c - a - t → cat" }
        ] },
        { "say": "一个字母一个字母地拼，再连起来读。" },
        { "say": "f, l, a, t, flat. c, a, t, cat.", "lang": "en" },
        { "boardClose": true },
        { "laser": "c1c" },
        { "say": "map, map", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1d" },
        { "say": "bag, bag", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "再听这两个词，结尾多了一个不发音的字母，前面的字母就读它本身的名字。" },
        { "say": "cake, name", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "所以，猫、公寓、地图、书包里是短音；蛋糕、名字里不是短音。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "学法口诀",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "学法口诀" },
        { "id": "l1", "kind": "bullets", "items": [
          "城里高楼街道长",
          "楼里一套叫公寓",
          "乡下农场小房子",
          "短音嘴巴张大读"
        ] },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "Chant: A cat on a mat in a flat." }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "我们用口诀把今天的单词记下来。跟我读。" },
        { "spotlight": "l1" },
        { "say": "城里高楼街道长，楼里一套叫公寓。" },
        { "say": "乡下农场小房子，短音嘴巴张大读。" },
        { "say": "前两句说城市里的楼房、街道和公寓，第三句说乡村的农场和房子，最后一句提醒短音要张大嘴。" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "再来一句英文小儿歌，拍着手读。" },
        { "say": "A cat on a mat in a flat. A cat on a mat in a flat.", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "小结",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "今天学了什么？" },
        { "id": "c1", "kind": "cards", "items": [
          { "id": "c1a", "text": "city · building · flat · street", "color": "blue" },
          { "id": "c1b", "text": "country · farm · house", "color": "green" }
        ] },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "a 的短音：cat, flat, map, bag" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "一句话小结：城市里有楼房、公寓和街道，乡村里有农场和房子。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "city, building, flat, street", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "country, farm, house", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "记得短音要张大嘴。下面我们来做小题。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "title": "判断题",
      "intro": "先判断对错。",
      "questions": [
        { "question": "city 的意思是“乡村”。", "options": ["对", "错"], "answer": [1], "analysis": "city 是城市，乡村是 country。" },
        { "question": "高楼里的一套房子，英语叫 flat。", "options": ["对", "错"], "answer": [0], "analysis": "flat 是公寓，就是楼房里的一套房子。" },
        { "question": "cake 里的 a 和 cat 里的 a 读音相同。", "options": ["对", "错"], "answer": [1], "analysis": "cat 里的 a 读短音；cake 结尾有不发音的 e，a 读字母本身的音。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "title": "选择题",
      "intro": "再来做选择题。",
      "questions": [
        { "question": "“农场”用英语怎么说？", "options": ["farm", "flat", "street"], "answer": [0], "analysis": "farm 是农场，flat 是公寓，street 是街道。" },
        { "question": "哪个单词里的 a 和 flat 里的 a 读音相同？", "options": ["name", "bag", "cake"], "answer": [1], "analysis": "bag 和 flat 里的 a 都读短音。" },
        { "question": "下面哪个单词是“楼房”？", "options": ["building", "country", "house"], "answer": [0], "analysis": "building 是楼房，country 是乡村，house 是一栋房子。" },
        { "question": "哪一组单词都是城市里常见的？", "options": ["farm, country", "building, street", "farm, house"], "answer": [1], "analysis": "城市里有楼房 building 和街道 street。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "title": "填空与情景交际",
      "intro": "最后做填空和情景交际。",
      "questions": [
        { "question": "Shenzhen is a big （　）.", "options": ["farm", "city", "house"], "answer": [1], "analysis": "深圳是一座大城市：a big city。" },
        { "question": "There are many cars on the （　）.", "options": ["street", "flat", "farm"], "answer": [0], "analysis": "汽车在街道 street 上跑。" },
        { "question": "你想告诉笔友：我爷爷奶奶住在乡村。你说（　）", "options": ["My grandparents live in the city.", "My grandparents live in the country.", "My grandparents live in a building."], "answer": [1], "analysis": "乡村是 the country。" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
